title: ActOneSceneTwoDashTwo
---
At the manor, LENNOX enters the foyer, seeing four individuals sitting in different positions in the room
LENNOX: Colorful cast.
REEVES: My thoughts exactly. How do you want to proceed?

-> Inform me on the women on the left with the tailored jumpsuit. ///(If you click on VOSS)
    <<jump vossIntro>>

-> Inform me of the big, scruffy guy wth the badly dyed hair. (If you click on DRACO)
    ///<<jump dracoIntro>>

-> Inform me on the stout man with freckles and dead eyes. ///(If you click on RIDDICK)
   <<jump riddickIntro>>

-> Inform me on the rightmost woman, who looks like she's seasick. ///(If you click on ECHO)
    <<jump echoIntro>>

-> No need, Eve. ///(If you choose to skip)
    LENNOX: We can move on. I’ve read the file.
    REEVES: Very well then. You can always look in your logs if you need a refresher.
    REEVES: So if that's all; let's get started.
    LENNOX: Right.


===

title: vossIntro
---
REEVES: Voss Axiom, 42. She’s the COO of AN.
LENNOX: Nova Axiom’s eldest daughter, then?
REEVES: She is. She supposedly helped organize the party; encouraged it even, with the help of her husband.
LENNOX: Why would she even be on this list? Shouldn’t she have already been interviewed?
REEVES: Should’ve been, yes. She refused to participate in any kind of interviews while in mourning. We had to press hard just for her to agree to come here today.
LENNOX: Sounds like a delightful character.
-> *Approach.*
    VOSS:
-> *Move on.*
<<
    LENNOX: Let's move on.
===

title: dracoIntro
---
REEVES: Dragomir “Draco” Drift, 35.
LENNOX: …Please tell me the name is a joke?
REEVES: Lysen.
LENNOX: Sorry, proceed.
REEVES: …They’re listed as a freelancer, though there isn’t any info for what. Originally from the anvil. They were pretty high on the invite list, though not being from any type of money.
LENNOX: So…the victim invited a street rat off the street to a party of elites. How…generous.
REEVES: LENNOX.
LENNOX: …moving on.
-> *Approach.*
    DRACO: 
-> *Move on.*
    LENNOX: Let's move on.
===

title: riddickIntro
---
REEVES: Riddick Vector, 37. 
LENNOX: He looks excited to be here.
REEVES: Vector’s from the steel, works directly with AN as a programmer of sorts. Apparently, was rather close to the deceased. 
LENNOX: How so?
REEVES: You and I both know that's not for us to know unless told by the suspect.
LENNOX: *…not if I have anything to say about it.*
-> *Approach.*
    RIDDICK:
-> *Move on.*
    LENNOX: Let's move on.
===

title: echoIntro
---
REEVES: Echo Proxy, 26.
LENNOX: Seems a little young to attend a 40 year old’s little celebration.
REEVES: Young, sure, but she's rather adept, it seems like. She was a top student at Shield.
LENNOX: You don’t say. Think she’s a prospective hire?
REEVES: I guess we’ll have to see.
-> *Approach.*
    ECHO:
-> *Move on.*
    LENNOX: Let's move on.
