title: vossSpeakDay1
---
VOSS: I see you're done with your snooping around, Lysander.
VOSS: In which case I suppose I'm next on the chopping block?
-> *Ask about her*
    VOSS: What business do you have to know about me? You’re here to find out what happened to my idiot brother.
    LENNOX:
    -> *Persist*
        VOSS: Lovely, you’re one of those.
        VOSS: What would you even want to know that isn't already globally known?
        VOSS: Eldest Daughter of Nova Axiom, PR rep, planning, syncing. 
        VOSS: There’s nothing special to it. I’m just a woman who keeps up with her job.
    -> *Let up*
        VOSS: That's what I figured.
-> *Pester* If scanned ///-1 sanity
    LENNOX: Classic life you have there.
    VOSS: What are you saying?
    LENNOX: Husband, two children. Good job. I’d assume you’re the breadwinner, given that it's a family business n all.
    VOSS: …I’m positive I never mentioned my children to you at any point, detective. And even if I had, in no way are they relevant to the conversation.
    -> *Proceed* ///-1 Sanity
        LENNOX:  Being the pride and joy of such a large company must be extremely taxing for you.
        VOSS: Y-You're being incredibly uncalled for, young man. Cut  it out.


    -> *Stop*
        LENNOX: ...nevermind me.
        VOSS: ...
        VOSS: sure
        REEVES: What the hell was that, Lysen?
        LENNOX: ...just experimenting a bit with my approach.

    -> *Threaten* [-1 Sanity]
        LENNOX: Would it not be easier to admit your wrong now and take a plea deal.
        LENNOX: I’d assume most children would prefer to have their mother in their life.
        VOSS: H-How dare you…! Who do you think you are, accusing me then threatening the wellbeing of my children?
        VOSS: I have no clue who the fuck you think you are, but I promise you, you will have so, so many more problems if you don’t fix your act. 
        VOSS: I’m done talking to you.

===

